# `onPermanent` on a permanent and `onInstantOrSorcery` on an instant or sorcery spell: a keyword
# the rules word differently for each [CR#702.131a,702.131b], [CR#702.55a], [CR#702.174b]. It is
# defined for those two cases the rules name.
primitive ifPermanentType(
  onPermanent: Ability,
  onInstantOrSorcery: Ability): Ability = IfPermanentType
